R_2(G)=\inf_{P\in\mathcal D_n,\,\widehat\tau\in\Gamma_n}
\sup_{Y\in\mathcal M_2(G)}
\mathbb E_{z\sim P}\!\left[
\left\{\widehat\tau(z,Y(z))-\tau_{\mathrm{DTE}}^G(Y)\right\}^2
\right].
\]
